# Raw response bodies are deliberately NOT committed, EXCEPT the carve-out below.
*
# CARVE-OUT (2026-10-13, area J). The 20 OPTIONS-phase bodies ARE committed:
# each is 0 bytes (the five 204 preflights) or 10 bytes of vendor error text
# ("Not found.") from the absent-path controls and the two unrouted candidates.
# No RSA modulus, no x5c, no certificate, no CN, no internal hostname, no
# session value -- verified before carving out (contents listed in FINDINGS.md
# §2). Without these, the byte-identity between candidates and controls that
# the unrouted verdicts turn on is not inspectable from a clean clone.
!c-*.b
!bc-*.b
!mfa-*.b
!gtr-*.b
